sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Voter as Voter (Client)
    participant UI as React 18 Frontend
    participant Server as Express Server
    participant Auth as JWT Auth Middleware
    participant VoteCtrl as Voting Controller
    participant DB as Relational Database
    participant Ledger as SHA-256 Ledger Engine

    Voter->>UI: Select Candidate & Click "Confirm Ballot"
    UI->>Server: POST /api/voting/cast {election_id, candidate_id}
    Server->>Auth: Validate JWT Token
    Auth-->>Server: Token Verified (user_id, role="voter")
    Server->>VoteCtrl: castVote(req, res)

    Note over VoteCtrl,DB: Begin ACID Database Transaction
    VoteCtrl->>DB: Check Election Status == 'active' & within timeframe
    VoteCtrl->>DB: Check voter_eligibility WHERE election_id=? AND voter_id=?
    
    alt Voter has already voted (has_voted == 1)
        DB-->>VoteCtrl: has_voted = 1
        VoteCtrl->>DB: ROLLBACK Transaction
        VoteCtrl-->>UI: HTTP 400 "DUPLICATE_VOTE: You have already cast your ballot."
        UI-->>Voter: Display Duplicate Vote Alert
    else Voter is Eligible & has_voted == 0
        VoteCtrl->>DB: UPDATE voter_eligibility SET has_voted=1, voted_at=NOW
        VoteCtrl->>Ledger: Compute One-Way Anon Token & Transaction Hash
        VoteCtrl->>Ledger: createLedgerBlock(election_id, tx_hash)
        Ledger->>DB: SELECT latest block current_hash AS previous_hash
        Ledger->>Ledger: Calculate new SHA-256 block hash
        Ledger->>DB: INSERT INTO blockchain_blocks (block_index, prev_hash, curr_hash, ...)
        Ledger-->>VoteCtrl: Return new block_id
        VoteCtrl->>DB: INSERT INTO votes (election_id, candidate_id, anon_token, block_id)
        VoteCtrl->>DB: INSERT INTO audit_logs (actor, action="VOTE_CAST")
        Note over VoteCtrl,DB: COMMIT Database Transaction
        VoteCtrl-->>UI: HTTP 200 "Vote cast securely and mined into blockchain."
        UI-->>Voter: Show Success Confirmation & Receipt Token
    end
